			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19094007">
			</marker>
			<v n="7">the God of Jacob does not perceive . ”</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19094008">
			</marker>
			<v n="8">Fools , when will you be wise ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19094009">
			</marker>
			<v n="9">He who formed the eye , does he not see ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19094010">
			</marker>
			<v n="10">He who<crossref let="e" cid="c19094010.2" />teaches man knowledge —</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19094011">
			</marker>
			<v n="11">that they are<crossref let="g" cid="c19094011.2" />but a breath .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19094012">
			</marker>
			<v n="12">and whom you teach out of your law ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19094013">
			</marker>
			<v n="13">until<crossref let="l" cid="c19094013.3" />a pit is dug for the wicked .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19094014">
			</marker>
			<v n="14">he will not abandon his<crossref let="n" cid="c19094014.2" />heritage ;</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19094015">
			</marker>
			<v n="15">and all the upright in heart will<crossref let="p" cid="c19094015.2" />follow it .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19094016">
			</marker>
			<v n="16">Who stands up for me against evildoers ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19094017">
			</marker>
			<v n="17">my soul would soon have lived in the land of<crossref let="s" cid="c19094017.2" />silence .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19094018">
			</marker>
			<v n="18">your steadfast love , O Lord ,<crossref let="u" cid="c19094018.2" />held me up .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19094019">
			</marker>
			<v n="19">your consolations cheer my soul .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19094020">
			</marker>
			<v n="20">those who frame injustice by<crossref let="x" cid="c19094020.2" />statute ?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19094021">
			</marker>
